2. In this Order —
“MSF Deputy Secretary” means any Deputy Secretary to the Ministry of Social and Family Development;
“MSF Permanent Secretary” means any Permanent Secretary to the Ministry of Social and Family Development;
“MSF political office holder” means —
(a)any Second Minister for Social and Family Development;
(b)any Minister of State assigned by the Prime Minister to assist the Minister for Social and Family Development; and
(c)any Parliamentary Secretary assigned by the Prime Minister to assist the Minister for Social and Family Development.
